@startuml PersonaJourneys
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAF8
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam defaultFontName "Plus Jakarta Sans"

title Peerly — Persona Interaction & Exchange Flows

actor "Haripriya M.\n(Seeker / Demand)" as Seeker
actor "Jean R.\n(Idle Owner / Supply)" as Owner
actor "Thirupathi M.\n(Bulk-Reseller / Commerce)" as Reseller
participant "Peerly Marketplace\n(Feed & Search)" as Feed
participant "Item Detail &\nChat Drawer" as Detail
participant "Accountability &\nTrust Engine" as Trust

== Journey 1: Haripriya (Seeker) borrows a Blazer for Case Finals ==
Seeker -> Feed : Searches "Blazer" or taps "Borrow" chip
Feed --> Seeker : Displays Navy Blazer (Size 40/M) in Hostel 3
Seeker -> Detail : Opens listing (#/item/l1)
Detail --> Seeker : Shows condition ("Like New"), location, owner trust score
Seeker -> Detail : Taps "Request to Borrow"
Detail -> Detail : Simulated accept spinner (500ms)
Detail --> Seeker : "Request Accepted!" with Return-by Date: "Thursday, 6:00 PM"
Seeker -> Detail : Taps "Open Chat"
Detail --> Seeker : Opens scripted chat drawer with Owner (Hostel 3 pickup)
Seeker -> Owner : Coordinates pickup at Hostel 3 lobby

== Journey 2: Jean R. (Passive Idle Owner) lists TI-84 in <60 Seconds ==
Owner -> Feed : Taps "+ Post an Item"
Feed -> Detail : Opens rapid Create Listing (#/new-listing)
Owner -> Detail : Selects preset photo "Calculator", Title: "TI-84 Plus CE"
Owner -> Detail : Toggles Mode: "Share (Lend)", Sets Return Terms: "3 Days / Exam Week"
Owner -> Detail : Taps "Post Item"
Detail -> Feed : Instantly adds item to top of live Campus Feed
Feed --> Owner : Success Toast & Live Listing Visibility
note over Owner, Feed
  Jean's calculator is now discoverable campus-wide
  without sending a single spam message on WhatsApp.
end note

== Journey 3: Thirupathi (Bulk Reseller) Sells Insulated Water Bottles ==
Reseller -> Detail : Opens Create Listing flow (#/new-listing)
Reseller -> Detail : Toggles Mode: "Sell", Price: ₹299 (MRP: ₹799)
Reseller -> Detail : Switches ON "Listing multiple units / bulk inventory?"
Detail -> Trust : Checks ID Verification status
Trust --> Detail : Confirms "Verified Seller" badge unlocked
Reseller -> Feed : Publishes listing
Feed --> Seeker : Shows item with "Verified Seller Batch" badge
Seeker -> Detail : Taps "Buy for ₹299" -> Scripted handoff with UPI payment on delivery

== Journey 4: Closed-Loop Return & Peer Accountability ==
Seeker -> Trust : Opens "My Peerly" (#/profile) -> Views Active Borrow Card
Seeker -> Trust : Taps "Mark as Returned"
Trust --> Seeker : Prompts Condition Check: "Returned in good condition?" (Yes/No)
Seeker -> Trust : Selects "Yes, Perfect Condition"
Trust --> Seeker : Prompts Peer Rating: "Rate experience with Owner: 👍 / 👎"
Seeker -> Trust : Selects "👍 Smooth & Friendly!"
Trust -> Trust : Bumps Owner's Trust Score (👍 19, 100%)
Trust -> Trust : Clears active borrow and updates campus trust index

@enduml
